    "Effective {effective_date}, {org_name}'s policy on {section_name} takes effect as a governing document in the Employee Handbook. The Company has developed it thoughtfully, reviewed it rigorously, and approved it at the appropriate levels. It deserves to be taken seriously — and the Company intends to apply it that way.",
