    "The following policy on {section_name} reflects the maturity of {org_name}'s approach to employment governance. The Company has moved beyond one-size-fits-all policies and generic boilerplate to develop standards that are specifically designed for its size, culture, and operational context.",
    "This policy on {section_name} is effective {effective_date} and is built to last. {org_name} has designed the provisions to remain applicable and relevant as the organization and its context evolve, while committing to the ongoing governance activities that ensure the policy remains current and accurately reflects the Company's actual standards.",
    "{org_name}'s policy on {section_name} is one of the Company's most important workplace governance documents. It has been prepared, reviewed, and approved with the care and rigor appropriate to that importance, and the Company is committed to applying its provisions consistently and fairly.",
