    "The standards established in this policy on {section_name} reflect {org_name}'s recognition that good employment governance benefits not just individual employees but the organization as a whole. By treating people well and managing consistently, the Company creates the conditions for sustainable organizational success.",
    "This policy on {section_name} is effective {effective_date} and is designed to be a genuine asset to employees and managers navigating situations in this area. The Company has invested in clarity, comprehensiveness, and practical utility, and is committed to making good on that investment through consistent, thoughtful application.",
