    "A SHRM Foundation study found that organizations with formal onboarding programs retain 50% more new employees after their first year than organizations without structured onboarding, representing a significant workforce stability advantage.",
    "Research by McKinsey & Company found that companies in the top quartile for gender diversity are 21% more likely to achieve above-average profitability, and companies in the top quartile for ethnic diversity are 33% more likely to outperform peers.",
